      {
        "id": 228121,
        "name": "Ario",
        "username": "Ario",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ario/{size}/1866_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-07-17T20:40:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I ran a few games of Masks. As it turns out my group didn't want to engage with the maturing idenity aspects of the game, which of course is the whole point, so it was a struggle.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Character creation was a lot of fun, and I enjoyed the system, but it didn't work out for us.</p>",
